{{Unobtainable}}
'''Celesse''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that could be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.9 Update|Version 2.2.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 110
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Celesse
|name2 = Celesse CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Celesse CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Celesse nearly mirrors [[Witch Cat (Rare Cat)|Witch Cat]] apart from having slightly higher HP. This isn't particularly bad, as both are able to reliably Slow Red enemies like [[Bore]] (and even more so when used together). However, Witch eventually gains the upper hand due to getting higher range and slow time in her [[True Form]], whilst also getting another trait target and [[Survive]] with [[Talents]].

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

